                <end-time>00:21:26,547</end-time>
                <translation>可以把某物和另一物在无形之中连结的</translation>
                <original>何かと何かを見えない形でも結んでいる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t vertical="0" torder="1" id="" index="441" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:26,547</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:28,287</end-time>
                <translation>那就是爱啊</translation>
                <original>それが愛なんだって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t vertical="0" torder="1" id="" index="442" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:28,287</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:29,806</end-time>
                <translation>我想这才是诗中所说的爱</translation>
                <original>いうことなんだろうと思うんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t vertical="0" torder="1" id="" index="443" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:29,806</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:31,686</end-time>
                <translation>所以在我们的生活中</translation>
                <original>だから私たちの中には</original>
