            <t vertical="0" torder="1" id="" index="444" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:31,686</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:33,246</end-time>
                <translation>本应存在着某种</translation>
                <original>こういう本当に人と人を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t vertical="0" torder="1" id="" index="445" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:33,246</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:35,706</end-time>
                <translation>真正能把人与人连结起来的东西</translation>
                <original>つなぐような何かが必要なのに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t vertical="0" torder="1" id="" index="446" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:35,706</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:38,305</end-time>
                <translation>但这个世界却四分五裂</translation>
                <original>世界が分断されている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t vertical="0" torder="1" id="" index="447" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:38,305</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:40,965</end-time>
                <translation>我们明明不可缺少这样的联系</translation>
                <original>こういうものがなくてはならないのに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t vertical="0" torder="1" id="" index="448" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:40,965</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:42,520</end-time>
                <translation>眼前却是一个缺少它的世界</translation>
                <original>そうじゃない世界が</original>
